## Root Cause: Stale Queue from S76P

The S76P planning session built the S077 queue against a cognitive census that was out of date.
Between the census snapshot and S077 execution, prior content upgrade sessions rewrote the 15 items.
This is a process gap — cross-session awareness of content state changes was insufficient.

**Recommended process improvement:** Before any cognitive upgrade session, run a fresh
Function-constructor-based census of the target section at T0 to validate queue freshness.

